(id,title,severity,category,ddl_op,feature,symptom,repro,expected,actual,root_cause,fix_hint,oracle,method,root_cause_id,affects,confirmed,status,issue_url,notes)
VALUES
(1890003,'Lightning importinto can skip new input because of a finished checkpoint from an older run','high','data_loss','TiDB Lightning importinto backend','finished table checkpoint','A new run with nonempty files for the same table can return success without submitting any IMPORT job when a retained checkpoint says the table finished in an older input lineage.','Retain a finished checkpoint for db.t with the supported keep-after-success strategy or reuse its checkpoint DSN; start another run for db.t with a different nonempty input file; observe SubmitAndWait result and SubmitTable count.','The checkpoint is accepted only when its input/config/target fingerprint matches the current run; otherwise the table is submitted or the run fails closed.','SubmitAndWait returns nil and logs no jobs to execute while SubmitTable is called zero times for the new nonempty input.','TableCheckpoint is keyed by table name and stores status/job/group but no input fingerprint; the Finished fast path skips unconditionally. The importinto success path implements only checkpoint removal and leaves rename/origin checkpoints reusable in place.','Persist and validate an input/config/target fingerprint, and implement keep-after-success rename semantics; treat mismatches as new work or a hard error.','lightning-import-checkpoint-submission-count','source-proof-local-input-lineage-matrix','lightning-importinto-finished-checkpoint-unbound-input','master 13282a8bd06b',1,'confirmed',NULL,'Current-source-only discovery. Cross-input RED returns nil with submissions=0; no-checkpoint submits once; existing same-run finished baseline skips. Post-RED GitHub issue searches found no exact root.');
